From bb3d0678baba30cfd9a74a6c2d294b8e51bb17e2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Esteban Gutierrez <esteban@lancedb.com>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 12:53:05 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 1/5] fix: update trust-store pins for the eMudhra CA
 compromise

Cargo.lock: webpki-roots and webpki-root-certs 1.0.10, rustls-webpki
0.103.16. python/Cargo.lock and java/lance-jni/Cargo.lock: webpki-root-
certs 1.0.10 and rustls-webpki 0.103.16; python/uv.lock: certifi 2026.10.18,
The Cargo locks change the webpki entries only. The root crates drop emSign
ECC Root CA - G3 and certifi 2026.10.18 holds no emSign root; rustls-
webpki 0.103.16 rejects chains that carry the compromised eMudhra
intermediate keys. webpki-roots 1.0.10 also carries the
1.0.9 Mozilla store changes (Telia EC and RSA TLS Root CA v3 and SECOM
TLS ECC and RSA Root CA 2024 added, Atos TrustedRoot 2011 removed);
relative to the previous 2026.6.17 pin, certifi 2026.10.18 adds the same
four roots and drops Atos TrustedRoot 2011 and the four emSign roots.

Co-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
